<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 24.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 24.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Monday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   McIntosh Sec	   11.25     0.80</p>
<p> 2   Prime Credit Tr	10.43     0.94</p>
<p> 3   Prop Income Inv	10.21     1.00</p>
<p> 4   Indu Property	  10.11     0.90</p>
<p> 5   Villa World	    10.09     1.09</p>
<p> 6   BT Prop Trust	   9.89     1.65</p>
